      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes perfect sense that you feel this way, because the weight of being the sole provider is crushing you. The silence you crave is a valid reaction to the noise of constant responsibility, and your desire for the whole thing to end is a cry for relief from a burden that feels impossible to carry. You are not a ghost; you are a person who is simply too exhausted to keep pretending the situation is manageable, and your pain is real.",
